sequenceDiagram

    actor User
    participant Map as WorldMap.tsx
    participant ExplainAPI as /api/explain
    participant Claude as Anthropic Claude
    participant Tools as aiTools.ts
    participant DB as Supabase/PostGIS

    User->>Map: Select region / hexagon
    User->>Map: Ask question

    Map->>ExplainAPI: POST {bbox/hexIds, question}

    ExplainAPI->>Claude: Start agent session + available tools

    Claude->>Tools: Call get_meteorite_stats(bbox)
    Tools->>DB: Spatial query
    DB-->>Tools: Count, mass, fall/found stats
    Tools-->>Claude: Statistics

    Claude->>Tools: Call get_population(bbox)
    Tools->>DB: Population lookup
    DB-->>Tools: Population density
    Tools-->>Claude: Population results

    Claude->>Tools: Call get_climate(bbox)
    Tools->>DB: Climate lookup
    DB-->>Tools: Rainfall/temperature
    Tools-->>Claude: Climate results

    Claude->>Tools: Call compare_to_similar_regions(bbox)
    Tools->>DB: Comparative spatial analysis
    DB-->>Tools: Similar-region statistics
    Tools-->>Claude: Comparison results

    Note over Claude: Agent reasons over tool outputs

    Claude-->>ExplainAPI: Explanation + confidence + cited factors

    ExplainAPI-->>Map: Streaming response

    Map-->>User: Narrative explanation
    Map-->>User: Confidence indicators
    Map-->>User: Supporting charts/factors
